{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TRVb39R7RkQJSyQKiBsVyW","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→import { db, Comment, Likes, eq, sql } from 'astro:db';\n     2→import { ActionError, defineAction } from 'astro:actions';\n     3→import { z } from 'astro/zod';\n     4→import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';\n     5→\n     6→export const server = {\n     7→\tlogout: defineAction({\n     8→\t\thandler: async () => {\n     9→\t\t\tawait new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 500));\n    10→\t\t},\n    11→\t}),\n    12→\tblog: {\n    13→\t\tlike: defineAction({\n    14→\t\t\tinput: z.object({ postId: z.string() }),\n    15→\t\t\thandler: async ({ postId }) => {\n    16→\t\t\t\tawait new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 500));\n    17→\n    18→\t\t\t\tconst result  = await db\n    19→\t\t\t\t\t.update(Likes)\n    20→\t\t\t\t\t.set({\n    21→\t\t\t\t\t\tlikes: sql`${Likes.likes} + 1`,\n    22→\t\t\t\t\t})\n    23→\t\t\t\t\t.where(eq(Likes.postId, postId))\n    24→\t\t\t\t\t.returning()\n    25→\t\t\t\t\t.get();\n    26→\n    27→\t\t\t\treturn result?.likes;\n    28→\t\t\t},\n    29→\t\t}),\n    30→\n    31→\t\tcomment: defineAction({\n    32→\t\t\taccept: 'form',\n    33→\t\t\tinput: z.object({\n    34→\t\t\t\tpostId: z.string(),\n    35→\t\t\t\tauthor: z.string(),\n    36→\t\t\t\tbody: z.string().min(10),\n    37→\t\t\t}),\n    38→\t\t\thandler: async ({ postId, author, body }) => {\n    39→\t\t\t\tif (!(await getCollection('blog')).find((b) => b.id === postId)) {\n    40→\t\t\t\t\tthrow new ActionError({\n    41→\t\t\t\t\t\tcode: 'NOT_FOUND',\n    42→\t\t\t\t\t\tmessage: 'Post not found',\n    43→\t\t\t\t\t});\n    44→\t\t\t\t}\n    45→\n    46→\t\t\t\tconst comment = await db\n    47→\t\t\t\t\t.insert(Comment)\n    48→\t\t\t\t\t.values({\n    49→\t\t\t\t\t\tpostId,\n    50→\t\t\t\t\t\tbody,\n    51→\t\t\t\t\t\tauthor,\n    52→\t\t\t\t\t})\n    53→\t\t\t\t\t.returning()\n    54→\t\t\t\t\t.get();\n    55→\t\t\t\treturn comment;\n    56→\t\t\t},\n    57→\t\t}),\n    58→\n    59→\t\tapply: defineAction({\n    60→\t\t\taccept: 'form',\n    61→\t\t\tinput: z.object({\n    62→\t\t\t\tname: z.string().min(2),\n    63→\t\t\t\temail: z.string().email(),\n    64→\t\t\t}),\n    65→\t\t\thandler: async ({ name, email }) => {\n    66→\t\t\t\treturn { name, email, submitted: true };\n    67→\t\t\t},\n    68→\t\t}),\n    69→\n    70→\t\tlotsOfStuff: defineAction({\n    71→\t\t\taccept: 'form',\n    72→\t\t\tinput: z.object({\n    73→\t\t\t\tone: z.string().min(3),\n    74→\t\t\t\ttwo: z.string().min(3),\n    75→\t\t\t\tthree: z.string().min(3),\n    76→\t\t\t\tfour: z.string().min(3),\n    77→\t\t\t\tfive: z.string().min(3),\n    78→\t\t\t\tsix: z.string().min(3),\n    79→\t\t\t\tseven: z.string().min(3),\n    80→\t\t\t\teight: z.string().min(3),\n    81→\t\t\t\tnine: z.string().min(3),\n    82→\t\t\t\tten: z.string().min(3),\n    83→\t\t\t}),\n    84→\t\t\thandler(form) {\n    85→\t\t\t\treturn form;\n    86→\t\t\t},\n    87→\t\t}),\n    88→\t},\n    89→\tsum: defineAction({\n    90→\t\taccept: 'form',\n    91→\t\tinput: z.object({\n    92→\t\t\ta: z.number(),\n    93→\t\t\tb: z.number(),\n    94→\t\t}),\n    95→\t\tasync handler({ a, b }) {\n    96→\t\t\treturn a + b;\n    97→\t\t},\n    98→\t}),\n    99→};\n   100→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01REm1BFVwZQZT3gEYb6usDZ","session_id":"ca373184-55de-43ea-b9dc-c45b48d70f8a","uuid":"4b6294ac-d957-48ab-b736-cce2c648d9b0"}
